flowchart TD
    IN[ReturnDecisionRequest<br/>message + claim + orders + policy evidence<br/>user_id + evaluated_at + language] --> PARSE[extract_return_claim<br/>regex-based extraction from message]
    PARSE --> FIELDS[Claim facts<br/>order number, item query, quantity,<br/>reason code, item condition]
    FIELDS --> GRAPH[ReturnDecisionAgentGraph<br/>single evaluate node]
    GRAPH --> AGENT[ReturnDecisionAgent.evaluate]
    AGENT --> HAS_EVIDENCE{policy evidence exists?}
    HAS_EVIDENCE -->|yes| PROVIDER[ReturnPolicyRuleProvider.get_rule_set]
    HAS_EVIDENCE -->|no| NO_RULES[rule_set = None]
    PROVIDER --> CONFIGURED{provider returns reviewed rules?}
    CONFIGURED -->|NoStructuredPolicyRules default| NO_RULES
    CONFIGURED -->|configured provider| RULESET[ReturnPolicyRuleSet<br/>version + effective date + conditions<br/>auto_decision_enabled]
    NO_RULES --> EVAL[evaluate_return_request<br/>pure deterministic evaluator]
    RULESET --> EVAL

    subgraph PRECHECK[Prechecks in evaluator]
        EVAL --> ORDER[Select one order<br/>match claim order number<br/>or require a unique order]
        ORDER --> ITEM[Select one item<br/>order_item_id, item query,<br/>or sole line item]
        ITEM --> QTY[Check requested quantity<br/>against purchased quantity minus<br/>completed and active returns]
    end

    QTY --> POLICY{Policy lookup and evidence usable?}
    POLICY -->|lookup failed / no evidence| REVIEW[manual_review]
    POLICY -->|evidence found, no enabled rules| REVIEW
    POLICY -->|reviewed enabled rules| DIMENSIONS[Evaluate configured dimensions<br/>order status, return window,<br/>reason, item condition]
    DIMENSIONS --> AGGREGATE[Aggregate check statuses<br/>pass / fail / unknown]
    AGGREGATE --> OUTCOME[Build ReturnDecisionResult<br/>outcome + checks + reason codes<br/>evidence refs + rule version]
    REVIEW --> OUTCOME
    QTY -. missing or ambiguous input .-> CLARIFY[needs_clarification<br/>ask for required fact]
    ORDER -. multiple possible orders .-> CLARIFY
    ITEM -. multiple or unknown item .-> CLARIFY

    NOTE[Default provider currently returns None.<br/>Retrieved policy text is not parsed into rules automatically.]
    NOTE -.-> NO_RULES

